            "notes": [
                {
                    "no": 1,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Good Afternoon Mrs test,\n\nThank you for your call, Please accept my apology in not getting this over to you on Friday! \n\nI have attached as spoken about the 14 nights at Caribbean Beach, when playing around with the dates today it actually better to travel out on the 16th rather than the 15th today, as this day is around£400 cheaper than the day before.\n\nAs mentioned, its currently best to add the Disney tickets to your stay as you don't have to pay any additional for these at this time. As spoken about on Friday (if) Disney offer the free dining plan for 2027 then we can look into adding this on for you. As mentioned on the phone on Friday we would currently be getting the best price for the flights for Aug 2027 and then we can later add in the dining, this is  on live pricing so this can slightly fluctuate however if your quite flexible we can then look at the date again, that wouldn't be an issue at all. \n\nI haven't added any universal tickets on as the kiddies are so little but if you wanted a price please do let me know. \n\nI know we spoken about the benefits of staying onsite and as mention I had done this in the August just gone, and it makes it so much more manageable, especially with young children and with the heat you can just jump back on the skyline to your hotel which is so great!\n\nIf you have any questions or queries please feel free to let me know!\n\nKind Regards, \nSydnee ",
                    "displayName": "Sydnee Nobbs",
                    "dateModified": "2025-12-09T13:29:14",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~1",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 2,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "16-29th 13 nights \n15-29th \n14-28th",
                    "displayName": "Sydnee Nobbs",
                    "dateModified": "2025-12-09T16:25:32",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~2",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 3,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Hi Catherine,\nThank you for your call, I've priced up all the options spoken about on the phone, please see these below. \nOption 1:\nDeparture: 15th August 2027, 08:35 AM from London Heathrow\nArrival: 15th August 2027, 13:20 PM at Orlando International\nAccommodation: 14 nights at Disney’s Caribbean Beach Resort in two rooms, each with two double beds\nDisney Tickets: Included\nReturn Flight: 29th August 2027, 17:40 PM from Orlando, arriving at London Heathrow on 30th August at 07:15 AM\nTotal Price: £24,054.81\nOption 2:\nDeparture: 16th August 2027, 08:35 AM from London Heathrow\nArrival: 16th August 2027, 13:20 PM at Orlando International\nAccommodation: 13 nights at Disney’s Caribbean Beach Resort in two rooms, each with two double beds\nDisney Tickets: Included\nReturn Flight: 29th August 2027, 17:40 PM from Orlando, arriving at London Heathrow on 30th August at 07:15 AM\nTotal Price: £22,769.21\nOption 3:\nDeparture: 14th August 2027, 08:35 AM from London Heathrow\nArrival: 14th August 2027, 13:20 PM at Orlando International\nAccommodation: 14 nights at Disney’s Caribbean Beach Resort in two rooms, each with two double beds\nDisney Tickets: Included\nReturn Flight: 28th August 2027, 17:40 PM from Orlando, arriving at London Heathrow on 29th August at 07:15 AM\nTotal Price: £23,996.97\nIf there's any other dates you think would work please do let me know, Ill be more than happy to help. \n\nKind Regards, \nSydnee",
                    "displayName": "Sydnee Nobbs",
                    "dateModified": "2025-12-09T17:41:42",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~3",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 4,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Good Afternoon Catherine, \n\nI hope you've had a good day. I just wanted to check in to see how you were getting on with the different prices? \n\nIf you have any questions please do feel free to let me know. I am here tomorrow 9am - 5.30pm should you have any questions or would like to look into any other options. \n\nKind Regards, \nSydnee",
                    "displayName": "Sydnee Nobbs",
                    "dateModified": "2025-12-10T17:39:57",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~4",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 5,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "repriced but not come down",
                    "displayName": "Sydnee Nobbs",
                    "dateModified": "2025-12-18T18:53:23",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~5",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 6,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Looked at travelling out a few days later whi ch take it down by £3000 - I will let customer know as Ive checked the school dates and Norlfok school terms states that the 1st and the 2nd are staff traing days - but I think passangers wanted to enbnsure they were back with a few days before school started - will check with pax as its a much better deal",
                    "displayName": "Sydnee Nobbs",
                    "dateModified": "2025-12-21T14:56:37",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~6",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 7,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Good Morning Catherine, \n\nI hope you're well and had a good Christmas and New Year, \n\n I just wanted to let you know that the options we were previously looking into have came down in cost, I've popped these below for you. \n\nDeparture: 14th August 2027, 08:35 AM from London Heathrow\nArrival: 14th August 2027, 13:20 PM at Orlando International\nAccommodation: 14 nights at Disney’s Caribbean Beach Resort in two rooms, each with two double beds\nDisney Tickets: Included\nReturn Flight: 28th August 2027, 15:25 PM from Orlando, arriving at London Heathrow on 29th August at 05:10 AM\nTotal Price: £23,602.63\n\nAs we are in the sale at the moment these flights have reduced lightly from before, we currently are the only provider that can book this so far in advance which gives you the massive advantage to get the best possible prices. \n\nAs mentioned previously, this price is based on room only however should they release the dining plan for 2027 holidays I am more than happy to apply a free of charge amendment to see if we can get this added on for you. \n\nAt the moment, if you wish to hod anything we are only taking a small depsoit of £500 for all of you to get this held and then nothing more has to be paid until 12 weeks before you go. \n\nIf you have any questions or there is anything I can do please do let me know. \n\nKind Regards, \nSydnee",
                    "displayName": "Sydnee Nobbs",
                    "dateModified": "2026-01-07T10:39:14",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~7",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 8,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Hi Catherine, \n\nThank you for your time on the phone earlier today. \n\nAs mentioned please see attached the updated price for Disney in 2027, as it has came down massively I just wanted to keep you in the loop. \n\nI know your still uncertain at the moment which is understandable but we do have a promotion on at the moment where the deposit if £500 for all of you and nothing more has to be paid until 12 weeks before you go. \n\nIf there's anything I can do please do let me know. \n\nKind Regards, \nSydnee ",
                    "displayName": "Sydnee Nobbs",
                    "dateModified": "2026-01-16T17:23:10",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~8",
                    "noteId": 0
                }
            ],
            "advNotes": [
                {
                    "no": 1,
                    "code": "Travel Insurance - comprehensive - all bookings",
                    "description": "Travel Insurance - comprehensive - all bookings",
                    "note": "We strongly recommend customers purchase Travel Insurance IMMEDIATELY to \nensure they are adequately covered should they need to cancel or postpone their\nholiday.  Travel insurance can be purchased with us via our website, please visit \nhttps://www.virginholidays.co.uk/travel-extras/travel-insurance",
                    "dateModified": "2024-12-31T10:42:15",
