                },
                {
                    "no": 3,
                    "code": "vhols booking app",
                    "description": "Package Travel Regulations 2018",
                    "note": "The combination of travel services offered to you is a package within\n the mean of the Package Travel and Linked Arrangements Regulations. \nTherefore, you will benefit from all the EU rights applying to the package.\nVirgin Holidays will be fully responsible for the proper performance of the\npackage as a whole. \n\nAdditionally, as required by law, Virgin Holidays has protection in place to\n refund your payments and, where transport is included in the package, to \nensure your repatriation in the event that it becomes insolvent. \n\nUnder the new regulations, you have Key Rights. Information about these \ncan be found with our terms and conditions on our website at\nwww.virginholidays.co.uk/important/terms-and-conditions.\n\nCan I also check that no one travelling has any medical conditions, dietary needs\nor severe allergies that we need to be made aware of, or do any travellers\nrequire special assistance?",
                    "dateModified": "2026-01-05T11:04:39",
                    "external": false,
                    "internal": true,
                    "priority": "H",
                    "itemInfo": [
                        "GEN 7",
