                    "title": "Country - US",
                    "compulsory": true
                },
                {
                    "no": 7,
                    "code": "Disney Ticket advisory",
                    "description": "Disney Ticket advisory",
                    "note": "*** IMPORTANT INFORMATION FOR ROOM & TICKET BOOKINGS*** \n\nIf you have selected the 'ROOM & TICKET' option, please ensure you have \nselected a ticket type which is located under supplements at point of booking.\n \nIf you do not select a ticket type you will not have a ticket booked, yet may \nstill be charged. \n\nIf no ticket is required, please go back, and select the 'Room Only' option.​\n\n\nDisney Magic Tickets can be purchased for 7- or 14-day Walt Disney World \nPark admission. \n\n14 Day Disney Magic Ticket Validity:14 Day Walt Disney World Park admission.\n14 Day Disney Magic Ticket is valid for an 18-day window from the selected \nstart date of the ticket. \n\n7 Day Disney Magic Ticket Validity: 7 Day Walt Disney World Park admission.\n7 Day Disney Magic Ticket is valid for a 15-day window from the selected \nstart date of the ticket.\n\nThe start date of the Disney Magic Ticket selected will be linked to the \nDisney Hotel check in date.",
                    "dateModified": "2025-03-20T11:34:43",
                    "external": true,
                    "internal": true,
                    "priority": "H",
