                    "no": 14,
                    "code": "Accessible Travel",
                    "description": "Accessible Travel",
                    "note": "If you have any medical requirements or need accessibility support during your \nstay, please email us at Accessible.Travel@virginholidays.com. \nThe Accessible Travel Services team can also help with any airport and onboard \nassistance you may have, more details are available here \nhttps://www.virginatlantic.com/en-US/help. \n\nIf you’re travelling with an airline other than Virgin Atlantic, \nplease contact the operating airline directly to arrange the necessary assistance.",
